  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accountable Grant with STAR Ghana for Inclusive Elections Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to STAR Ghana Foundation to work with civil society organisations with the aim of influencing inclusive elections by engaging organizations of underserved groups and political parties on their manifestos; advocating with election management bodies on issues of accessibility to ensure full participation of persons with disabilities and hard to reach communities in election processes; and building consensus among CSOs on pre and post-election accountability mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
